# Bundled Classic API polyfill (self-contained; replaces the former hard !!!ClassicAPI dependency).
# Must load before WrathBootstrap, which patches/extends it. All shims are define-if-missing, so when
# the external !!!ClassicAPI addon is present (e.g. for Clique/TPT) it loads first and this copy is inert.
